  "description": "Saint Kitts and Nevis Housing and Social Development Levy on wages for 2026. Covers the exemption cutoffs from 1 July 2025 (EC$520 a week, EC$1,040 fortnightly, EC$1,126.67 twice monthly, EC$2,253.33 monthly), the employee levy of 3.5% of total earnings to EC$6,500 a month, 10% from EC$6,500.01 to EC$8,000 and 12% above, the employer's 3% on all wages, no ceiling, payment with Form C3, the 10% and 1% a month late penalties, and the severance payment contribution of 1%. Trigger phrases include St Kitts housing levy, HSD levy, social development levy Nevis.",
